{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1000_p", "source_sha256": "73bf26954d41eb56535a968d95ea0d7e5d5cd3d9e921d846a5a790a2b9054633", "ja": "（さて、新曲の話と新しい仕事の話があるんだけど……\n奈緒はどこにいるかな？）", "zh": "（好了，有新歌的事，还有新工作的事……奈绪现在在哪儿呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "6fb9bd4c457c5670c3722d2dc4a6ec267e8ee2d3d00ef2d7e7d68dc52b40fc1c", "ja": "アイドルっぽいかぁ。奈緒だったら、カッコイイ曲とか\n似合いそうだよね？　前にモデルの仕事もしてるし！", "zh": "很有偶像风格吗？要是奈绪的话，感觉很适合帅气的歌曲呢？她之前也做过模特的工作！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "c9be5e27a491a6bcf51b5878ca6119090bfcbc624d5c8f72daaada5b9fb7084c", "ja": "学校のみんなも、奈緒さんのこと……\nカッコいいって、言って……ます。", "zh": "学校里的同学也都说，奈绪……很帅气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "4c3272ec47327d61d5eedc2a6e8a02d9ff834a28e2446516ec69e6eb8df0f428", "ja": "うわっ、今度は私が褒められる番？　まいったな～、\nそんな褒めても、アメちゃんしか出てこーへんで？", "zh": "哇，这次轮到我被夸了吗？真是的～\n就算这么夸我，也只能拿出糖来哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "98f5cdf7ffb0511dfc05a359b28afd0cc4e013a16c5ce8bc9dd750ac34167312", "ja": "奈緒さん……いつもアメ、持ってる……の？", "zh": "奈绪姐……一直都带着……糖果吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "10a0a87c7ba5ab03ed7aaadc54dd8e37ebb9eda1ca4c1b5584be6099b9d210a0", "ja": "もちろん！　アメちゃん切らすとか、\nアイドルとして死活問題やからな！", "zh": "当然啦！糖果这种东西要是断货了，可就是偶像的生死攸关问题了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1006_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1007_p", "source_sha256": "30e4cd492e786dcdafdd7765c5979420b6e8a3429f45c74189687a788c4d8d16", "ja": "奈緒、ここにいたのか。\nちょっと話があるんだけど、いいか？", "zh": "奈绪，原来你在这里啊。\n我有点事想和你说，现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "576465a8946f292472b8af234931f9897db064245b7c5acac9a3d6dbcd5340a0", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん！\n全然いいですよ～。なんですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n当然可以呀～什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b67334885c02220c0aa50f1860b1bd0fc84a42d0a878dec0f5e49645d7622110", "ja": "ああ、話は二つあるんだけど……まず一つ目。\n奈緒に『アイグラ！！』からオファーがきたんだ。", "zh": "啊，我有两件事要说……先说第一件。\n奈绪收到了《アイグラ！！》发来的邀约。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1010_p", "source_sha256": "bd27af58cd1ddcb84ddd99d3b7ed20a79b2db8981d842dcb5466376f710264ed", "ja": "WEB動画の企画で、『デート風のシチュエーションで\nオススメの飲食店を紹介する』らしい。", "zh": "是网络视频的企划，内容好像是“以约会风格的情境\n来介绍推荐的餐厅”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "bafbd1391de66bc2cf6403c627fc3fd0a1d8107fdd994d3b074187bb935a7c4c", "ja": "デート……。\n奈緒さん、デート……するの？", "zh": "约会……  \n奈绪姐，要约会……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1012_p", "source_sha256": "51eb23adc75568b749c6052887bb27e635d76fb60d6e49060182640b0a0d8609", "ja": "カメラマンさんを相手に撮影するみたいだから、\nデートしている演技をする感じだな。", "zh": "听说是要和摄影师进行拍摄，所以感觉是要演出约会的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "bb08e56f3031e99915eda3d6536a12e85c115119b8f0cf93aba729157a2f2171", "ja": "その企画、聞いたことあるかも！　たしか、\n人気のモデルさんとか女優さんが出てるヤツだよね？", "zh": "那个企划，我好像听说过！我记得是有人气模特和女演员参加的那个吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "774e2c54c63bbfd15e6f336550d985b6ca0c6b2a1c06deb34a9b42366a7c8963", "ja": "ええっ、そうなん！？　それは……。\n私、さすがに浮きません？", "zh": "诶诶，是这样的吗！？那我……不会显得格格不入吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1015_p", "source_sha256": "abcf440e816273c9c944f7f1aceab48af71fdeee8eb0ca2a4e5f34fd3295b811", "ja": "大丈夫だよ。先方は奈緒のモデルの仕事ぶりを見て、\n気に入ったみたいで。是非にって言ってくれてるんだ。", "zh": "没事的。对方看了奈绪做模特时的工作表现，\n好像很中意你。还说务必请你去呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "12d494f378df28088f930f2f269c0f8a3353e92f770b3b57bcdeb86044422583", "ja": "そ、そうなんですか……えへへっ♪　そういうことなら\nわかりました！　どーんと私に任せてください！", "zh": "这、这样啊……嘿嘿♪　既然是这样，\n我明白了！尽管交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "1d0535f948367229689dd3a459c588ab827973adfe054151dd8970e240a600eb", "ja": "デート風いうんがハードル高そうやけど、仕事ついでに\n美味しいもんも食べられるチャンスは逃しません！", "zh": "说是约会风格，听起来好像门槛有点高，不过顺便工作还能吃到美味的东西，这种机会我可不会错过！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4ae5f919a8f0de1a614478b3e19c243f695023a03b0952a6d85a8b5d25af6eb3", "ja": "はは、わかった。あとで先方に返事をしておくよ。\nそれと、もう一つの話だけど……。", "zh": "哈哈，知道了。我之后会回复对方的。\n还有另一件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a562785fd8f7f9ceedfe9d05b777cc4e355cbb00412295944dc9463bd6fa46d1", "ja": "次の定期公演で、新曲を歌ってみないか？", "zh": "要不要在下一次定期公演上试着唱新歌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "647169e82bd45c1d51d50af8c1759af29e345d852089c8d4e44857d82934217a", "ja": "新曲を、私が……？　ほんまですか！？", "zh": "新歌要让我来唱……？真的吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1021_p", "source_sha256": "11ee4b25d24f6c87616b6be24ce8e4cf6bce7269a890dc8ceeb55c0817bf015a", "ja": "ああ。『Super Lover』って曲なんだ。\nデモが届いたから、ちょっと聴いてみよう。", "zh": "嗯。这首歌叫《Super Lover》。\n试听曲已经送到了，先听听看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1023_037nao", "source_sha256": "958d9b934785adc05f8a910899deafc716f55d7b1d0db8d55a17646bed62dcc4", "ja": "おお……。", "zh": "喔喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1024_043nor", "source_sha256": "958d9b934785adc05f8a910899deafc716f55d7b1d0db8d55a17646bed62dcc4", "ja": "おお……。", "zh": "喔喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1025_024ann", "source_sha256": "7fd4cf42423e4adddae5a3a48fc66bf9dc871ef68c8b6c1bb0027c5e3e946ae6", "ja": "わあ……。", "zh": "哇啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1026_p", "source_sha256": "8c2e69110a92915716369945ebbf114b252e2d0603e8a926933f1e9a4d312758", "ja": "どうだ、奈緒？", "zh": "怎么样，奈绪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "09572316478d62e1667aa9d737c1fb96c667cd1bfde89d492070b59d6805259b", "ja": "……ハッ！　ビックリしすぎて、全然リアクション\nできませんでした。なんていうか、カッコいいですね？", "zh": "……啊！刚才太吃惊了，完全没反应\n过来。该怎么说呢，好帅气啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1028_043nor", "source_sha256": "faa233878fbe687a2627805753ec3a3bbfc12bf317c8fa0d3b7eb4649d6178e3", "ja": "うん、それに色っぽいっていうか妖しい感じっていうか\n……でも、奈緒なら意外とビシッと決めてくれそう！", "zh": "嗯，而且该说是性感还是妖艳的感觉呢\n……不过，奈绪的话感觉会意外利落地驾驭好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1029_024ann", "source_sha256": "7447021e1718a90534bd7082a8c50fe1a441b8959336ad5079caf19e37b498bf", "ja": "杏奈もドキドキ、です。\n奈緒さんが歌うの、すごく……楽しみ♪", "zh": "杏奈也心跳加速了。\n奈绪小姐要唱歌，真的……好期待♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1030_037nao", "source_sha256": "338e899ed2ab22cd88f503b67b578b8657b700319c7c6049ee3d6b091f44e4e7", "ja": "のり子、杏奈……。ふたりとも、ありがとうな～！\nなんや、めっちゃ自信わいてきたわ！", "zh": "诺莉子、杏奈……你们两个，谢谢啦～！\n怎么说呢，感觉自信一下子就涌上来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1031_037nao", "source_sha256": "5387c64dbbad93a6c088de488092573d1e7c1e0688d939db1489da490d5fb0fc", "ja": "よっしゃ！　いよいよ、私の本気を……\n真のアイドル力を発揮する時がきたみたいやな！", "zh": "好嘞！终于到了发挥出我的真本事……\n真正的偶像之力的时候啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1032_p", "source_sha256": "c4e774a9d7c40feed12c9789d50cbc26e25b9515d7ecb50b38c3bf46933b1ba9", "ja": "えっ。……な、なんだそれは？", "zh": "咦……那、那是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1033_037nao", "source_sha256": "18ef7e7af96cb2c70dd21bee70cc46b15e1a3db27a3643cf53ba09fa34da7516", "ja": "言うたとおりです！　雑誌の仕事もデート風やし、\n貰った曲も『Super Lover』、つまり『超恋人』！", "zh": "就像我说的！杂志的工作也是约会风格，收到的曲子也叫《Super Lover》，也就是《超级恋人》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1034_037nao", "source_sha256": "c62b2c25d32690029f4308e99bdc10406c66c38b27a72550c45dae4f547e0536", "ja": "私は、今こそ本気で、みんなの『超恋人』……。\nつまり『メッチャすごい恋人』になってみせるっ！！", "zh": "我现在要认真地，成为大家的“超级恋人”……也就是“超厉害的恋人”！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1035_043nor", "source_sha256": "e72f98235a694f9c6ccfbeb86aebefe8ce994e22425a312d1fbc11d9c7836a2e", "ja": "メッチャすごい、恋人……！？（ゴクリ）", "zh": "超厉害的恋人……！？（咽了口唾）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1036_024ann", "source_sha256": "d451af254daea237862e6fee4bcd40f150e07d346757ddb5a5eb8974006e3bab", "ja": "よく、わかんないけど……\nなんか、スゴそう……！", "zh": "虽然不太明白……\n总觉得，好像很厉害……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1037_p", "source_sha256": "a5f2f17c11a1d174c51ae9c760222bb106e9b2dfec01e4134ae94a9bc53f6a38", "ja": "……アイドルとファンは恋人みたいな関係ってことか。\nよし、奈緒！　そんなに間違ってないぞ！", "zh": "……也就是说，偶像和粉丝是类似恋人的关系吗。\n好，奈绪！并不算错哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1038_037nao", "source_sha256": "91d0ab2c7a850c23b14548760e51745feb48b60ae0e65fec7195ba0da70dbaf9", "ja": "さすが{$P$}さん、わかってますね！\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "不愧是{$P$}先生，真懂行！\n谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_076_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_076_1039_037nao", "source_sha256": "eb0effcf1f72f082a2050e5d79f85c75c3acfd539fb6418a9e757a4fa4ce72a0", "ja": "よっしゃ！　クールでカッコいいNEW横山奈緒で、\n会場のみんなを夢中にさせたるでー！", "zh": "好嘞！用酷炫帅气的NEW横山奈绪，让现场的大家都为之着迷吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
